      "description": "Three quarters of a second, the pool's life. The puddle spreads out to size in the first fifth and then just sits; what moves after that is the acid working \u2014 bubbles rising one after another, each swelling to a pop and gone, the two beads bobbing, the sheen drifting. The fade out belongs to the game, which is already scaling the sprite's alpha by how much life the pool has left.",
